{
  "info": {
    "name": "GREIP COMPANY - API",
    "description": "Colección Postman de las APIs de GREIP COMPANY (DEV).\n\nServicios:\n- service-security (base path /srv-security): autenticación (auth), usuarios + RBAC (user/role/permission) y auditoría (audit).\n- service-catalogs (base path /srv-catalogs): catálogo de productos (product).\n\nAutenticación:\n- Todos los endpoints requieren header `x-api-key` (variable apiKey).\n- Los endpoints protegidos requieren `Authorization: Bearer <token>` (variable token) y permisos RBAC.\n\nEl request 'Login' guarda automáticamente el access token en la variable `token`; el 'Create user' guarda `userId`; el 'Create role' guarda `roleId`; el 'Create product' guarda `productId`.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "api-server",
      "value": "https://apidev.greip.com.pe"
    },
    {
      "key": "ak-service-security",
      "value": "{{ak-service-security}}"
    },
    {
      "key": "ak-service-catalogs",
      "value": "{{ak-service-catalogs}}"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "userId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "roleId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "sk",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "productId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "ak-service-cross",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "service-security / Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "x-api-key",
                "value": "{{ak-service-security}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"admin@greip.com.pe\",\n  \"password\": \"Greip#2026\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{api-server}}/srv-security/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{api-server}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "srv-security",
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Iniciar sesión por email (o documentType + documentNumber). Si el usuario tiene MFA activo, responde un desafío en lugar de tokens."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const body = pm.response.json().payload;",
                  "if (body && body.data && body.data.accessToken) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('token', body.data.accessToken);",
                  "  console.log('Token guardado');",
                  "} else {",
                  "  console.log('Login sin accessToken (posible desafío MFA):', JSON.stringify(body));",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Verify MFA",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "x-api-key",
                "value": "{{ak-service-security}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"mfaToken\": \"eyJ...\",\n  \"challengeId\": \"uuid-del-desafio\",\n  \"code\": \"123456\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{api-server}}/srv-security/auth/mfa/verify",
              "host": [
                "{{api-server}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "srv-security",
                "auth",
                "mfa",
                "verify"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Refresh token",
